  "notes": "Fixes startup worker creation by replacing heap-sensitive dynamic allocation for support_tasks and charge_ctrl3072 with deterministic statically allocated, explicitly aligned internal stacks and statically allocated internal TCB storage. Existing task admission gates, release order, priorities, and core assignment remain unchanged. Retains 0.1.540 Wi-Fi OTA boot intent, native three-row LED menu, and flashlight scroll redundancy fix. Charge wake leaves the flashlight lamp off regardless of USB state; Desktop/Settings lamp controls remain available with USB attached. Hardware acceptance for 0.1.541 remains pending. The installed 0.1.540 Wi-Fi OTA reboot previously failed during support_tasks creation at sequence 10902; manual power boot later confirmed 0.1.540 but does not verify 0.1.541. Old SW6106 hardware diagnostics remain paused.",
